      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Agree.  I made a post here about this as well (after this one, and probably in the wrong spot) : https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/whitelist-dynamicboneplanecollider-component\n\nAFAIK, the performance is comparable to a normal collider, I'd think.  Currently if you try to mimic this with a sphere collider, you need more, bigger colliders and even then it doesn't work right usually since the individual bones just slip around the sphere collider. :/ \n\nSo, it would probably actually be *more* performant than the current sphere colliders, even if an individual plane collider is worse than a sphere.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "5b5d9b21f4f4e84727c517ef",
      "author": {
        "_id": "59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5",
        "alias": "Neat Swordtail",
        "aliasID": "65ba016fed6eefce4cf1884a",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/c959bcb3ee68106f8a04726004a45aa2.jpg",
        "created": "2017-09-12T16:35:07.113Z",
        "name": "Noe",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "<redacted>"
      },
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2018-07-29T10:46:57.531Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5b5d9b21f4f4e84727c517ef",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It looks like this component of dynamic bones is currently blacklisted in the SDK: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/416861586720948224/441561368546508800/Screenshot_2018-05-03_06.26.46.png\n\nCan we get this whitelisted in future releases? \n\nIt's an excellent way to keep hair in place without having to try to mess with round colliders that the bones just slip around. \n\nExample values showing what all it does: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/416861586720948224/441562185500590083/unknown.png",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Whitelist DynamicBonePlaneCollider Component",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5a9de48456ea4c419141a7f5",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
