      "value": "\"Unless this is so expensive on compute to destroy frames\" It would actually save frames to use the plane colliders. Bcuz with the round colliders most ppl, and I have to make them huge, or add more than we would have to with plane colliders. Causing more dynamic bone collision checks, then we would have with the plane colliders.",
